  "capability_limits": [
    "Only mock token backend ships; no Algorand/Solana backend, signer, mint, funding or settlement delivered.",
    "CallerAuthorization is trusted-host input, not a credential. Transport/issuer integration and current-grant resolution are absent; FAM cannot detect expiry/revocation of an old context. Low-level CRUD is trusted persistence, not an authenticated public endpoint.",
    "Stored identity/independence is checked, but historical verifier grants are not synthesized or proven.",
    "SQLite initiation remains VERIFIED/INITIATED with no transaction reference or payment time; memory completion is simulation. Result-chain mismatch is checked after backend call, without rollback guarantee; launch registry residue may remain.",
    "FX has19 canonical registry records and5 public projections, not19/115 confirmed assets or markets. Declared tickers are not deployed/liquid/tradable assets. No nomination/claim/mint/trading endpoint added.",
    "Venue sources are dated mutable-branch research; immutable pins, deployed code, testnet availability, licenses for exact components and account/venue authorization remain integration gates.",
    "Current repository-claim, issuer, accounting/proof/replay and testnet settlement layers remain open."
